# Unbloarchy core package list pacstrapped by the ISO.
# The ISO builder also reads this file when constructing the offline mirror.
# Stock power-profiles-daemon has no cppc_cpufreq driver, so profiles do nothing
# on ARM laptops. Back to stock once upstream merges MR !236 and !239.
